@PrestamosUcayNet.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5158
@token = 

### Login
POST {{PrestamosUcayNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ucaynet.com",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### Solicitudes pendientes
GET {{PrestamosUcayNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/solicitudes/pendientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Solicitudes aprobadas
GET {{PrestamosUcayNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/solicitudes/aprobadas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Evaluar capacidad de pago
POST {{PrestamosUcayNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/solicitudes/evaluar-capacidad
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "empleadoId": 1,
  "condicionCreditoId": 1,
  "montoSolicitado": 50000,
  "plazoMeses": 24,
  "fondeadoraId": 1
}

### Condiciones de crédito activas
GET {{PrestamosUcayNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/catalogos/condiciones-credito
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Préstamos activos
GET {{PrestamosUcayNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/prestamos/activos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
